						"image": "fit_content_assets/image-gallery.images%5B0%5D.image-1539239544541.jpeg",
						"caption": "# **Airport Security** <br>\nThe TSA has a long list of things you can't bring onto a commercial flight. This includes thing like scissors, cigarette lighters, car airbags, and even pool cues. \n\nAnd of course, guns, knives, bombs, and other weapons.\n"
					},
					{
						"image": "fit_content_assets/image-gallery.images%5B1%5D.image-1539239538646.jpeg",
						"caption": "# **Safety** <br>\nIts better to be safe than sorry. If something looks suspicious or raises an alarm during the screening process, pass it through the X-ray machine again and alert your supervisor."
					},
					{
						"image": "fit_content_assets/image-gallery.images%5B2%5D.image-1539239514041.png",
						"caption": "# **Prohibited items** <br>\nIn this lesson, we will go over some items that belong in the following categories ---  **sharp objects** and **liquids**"
