						"content": "# **Knives** <br>\n## **Carry On Bags: No**  <br>\n## **Checked Bags: Yes**  <br>\n\nExcept for plastic or round bladed butter knives.\n\nAny sharp objects in checked bags should be sheathed or securely wrapped to prevent injury to baggage handlers and inspectors.\n",
